पितॄणामर्यमा चास्मि यम: संयमतामहम् ॥ २९ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":3029,\"bb\":2679,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/10/29/b2679/\",\"body_value\":\"anantaś cāsmi nāgānāṁ
varuṇo yādasām aham
pitṝṇām aryamā cāsmi
yamaḥ saṁyamatām aham\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":3030,\"bb\":2680,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/10/29/b2680/\",\"shadow_value\":\"anantaḥ – Ananta; ca – also; asmi – I am; nāgānām – of the many-hooded serpents; varuṇaḥ – the demigod controlling the water; yādasām – of all aquatics; aham – I am; pitṝṇām – of the ancestors; aryamā – Aryamā; ca – also; asmi – I am; yamaḥ – the controller of death; saṁyamatām – of all regulators; aham – I am.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"anantaḥ\",\"translation\":\"Ananta\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"},{\"word\":\"asmi\",\"translation\":\"I am\"},{\"word\":\"nāgānām\",\"translation\":\"of the many-hooded serpents\"},{\"word\":\"varuṇaḥ\",\"translation\":\"the demigod controlling the water\"},{\"word\":\"yādasām\",\"translation\":\"of all aquatics\"},{\"word\":\"aham\",\"translation\":\"I am\"},{\"word\":\"pitṝṇām\",\"translation\":\"of the ancestors\"},{\"word\":\"aryamā\",\"translation\":\"Aryamā\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"},{\"word\":\"asmi\",\"translation\":\"I am\"},{\"word\":\"yamaḥ\",\"translation\":\"the controller of death\"},{\"word\":\"saṁyamatām\",\"translation\":\"of all regulators\"},{\"word\":\"aham\",\"translation\":\"I am\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":3031,\"bb\":2681,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/10/29/b2681/\",\"body_value\":\"Of the many-hooded Nāgas I am Ananta, and among the aquatics I am the demigod Varuṇa. Of departed ancestors I am Aryamā, and among the dispensers of law I am Yama, the lord of death.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":3032,\"bb\":2682,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/10/29/b2682/\",\"body_value\":\"Among the many-hooded Nāga serpents, Ananta is the greatest, as is the demigod Varuṇa among the aquatics. They both represent Kṛṣṇa. There is also a planet of Pitās, ancestors, presided over by Aryamā, who represents Kṛṣṇa. There are many living entities who give punishment to the miscreants, and among them Yama is the chief. Yama is situated in a planet near this earthly planet. After death those who are very sinful are taken there, and Yama arranges different kinds of punishments for them.\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 10.29\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 10.29\"},\"locale\":\"en\",\"activeView\":\"$6:props:activeView\"}]}],\"$L25\",\"$L26\",\"$L27\"]}]\n"])self.__next_f.push([1,"29:I[83068,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n2f:I[78455,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n25:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-4 w-full max-w-screen-xl mx-auto md:px-8 mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Breadcrumb\",\"className\":\"breadcrumb mb-8 text-base\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"ol\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"/en/library/\",{\"className\":\"inline\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L20\",null,{\"href\":\"/en/library/\",\"className\":\"text-vb-link\",\"children\":\"Library\"}],\" » \"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"/en/library/bg/\",{\"className\":\"inli